---
---
<section class="py-20 bg-gray-50/50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Heading -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">
        Kata Guru yang Sudah Merasakan Manfaatnya
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 font-medium">
        Ulasan jujur dari rekan-rekan guru yang telah menghemat ribuan jam lembur administratif.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Testimonials Grid (6 cards) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Testimonial 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100 shadow-premium flex flex-col justify-between hover-scale relative overflow-hidden">
        <span class="absolute right-6 top-4 text-7xl font-extrabold text-brand-primary/5 pointer-events-none select-none">“</span>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-400">
            {Array.from({ length: 5 }).map(() => (
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="lucide lucide-star"><path d="M12 17.27 18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/></svg>
            ))}
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-semibold italic text-sm">
            "Dulu saya bisa lembur sampai jam 11 malam hanya untuk bikin RPP. Sekarang pakai GuruDokAI, 10 menit sudah selesai semua!"
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-50">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-primary/10 text-brand-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg shadow-inner">
            B
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-950">Budi Santoso</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium">Guru Matematika SMP, Jawa Tengah</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100 shadow-premium flex flex-col justify-between hover-scale relative overflow-hidden">
        <span class="absolute right-6 top-4 text-7xl font-extrabold text-brand-primary/5 pointer-events-none select-none">“</span>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-400">
            {Array.from({ length: 5 }).map(() => (
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="lucide lucide-star"><path d="M12 17.27 18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/></svg>
            ))}
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-semibold italic text-sm">
            "Modul ajar dan bank soal HOTS-nya sudah sesuai kurikulum merdeka. Pengawas sekolah pun tidak ada complain. Sangat membantu!"
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-50">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-primary/10 text-brand-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg shadow-inner">
            S
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-950">Sari Dewi</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium">Guru Bahasa Indonesia SMA, Surabaya</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100 shadow-premium flex flex-col justify-between hover-scale relative overflow-hidden">
        <span class="absolute right-6 top-4 text-7xl font-extrabold text-brand-primary/5 pointer-events-none select-none">“</span>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-400">
            {Array.from({ length: 5 }).map(() => (
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="lucide lucide-star"><path d="M12 17.27 18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/></svg>
            ))}
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-semibold italic text-sm">
            "Saya guru honorer dengan gaji terbatas. Paket 19rb-nya sangat terjangkau tapi fiturnya lengkap. Akhirnya ada aplikasi yang paham kondisi guru!"
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-50">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-primary/10 text-brand-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg shadow-inner">
            A
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-950">Ahmad Fauzi</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium">Guru IPA SD, Bandung</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 4 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100 shadow-premium flex flex-col justify-between hover-scale relative overflow-hidden">
        <span class="absolute right-6 top-4 text-7xl font-extrabold text-brand-primary/5 pointer-events-none select-none">“</span>
